WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.311
Week 10: Likes, Preferences, and Leisure. express likes and dislikes invite and suggest compare activities

2
00:00:07.311 --> 00:00:19.873
Operational objective. By the end of this section you can express likes and dislikes, invite and suggest, compare activities. The focus is useful performance, not isolated terminology.

3
00:00:19.873 --> 00:00:28.081
Language system. Gustar-type verbs; indirect-object pronouns; infinitives after preference verbs; comparisons.

4
00:00:28.081 --> 00:00:36.779
Sound and delivery. Palatal ñ and y/ll variation without treating one regional realization as superior.

5
00:00:36.779 --> 00:00:46.205
Core principle. Notice meaning first, then form. Retrieve the new language aloud, compare it with the model, and repair one feature at a time.

6
00:00:46.205 --> 00:01:13.956
Model language. Me gusta escuchar música en vivo. — I like listening to live music. A Tomás le interesan los documentales. — Tomás is interested in documentaries. ¿Prefieres salir o quedarte en casa? — Do you prefer going out or staying home? Nos encanta jugar juntos. — We love playing together. El senderismo es más tranquilo que el fútbol. — Hiking is calmer than soccer.

7
00:01:13.956 --> 00:01:23.875
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
